# ---------------- 5. z-밀도 프로파일 (S2 비교 baseline) ----------------
compute         chO  gO  chunk/atom bin/1d z lower 0.5 units box
compute         chSi gSi chunk/atom bin/1d z lower 0.5 units box
fix             pO  gO  ave/chunk 1 1 1 c_chO  density/mass file zprof_O_raw.dat
ERROR: Chunk/atom compute does not exist for fix ave/chunk (src/fix_ave_chunk.cpp:311)
Last command: fix             pO  gO  ave/chunk 1 1 1 c_chO  density/mass file zprof_O_raw.dat
